B.aot=new A.F(B.cV_,['<p style="text-align:right">Date: {Today}<br>Ref: {Letter number}</p>\n<p><strong>To Whom It May Concern</strong></p>\n<p style="text-align:center"><strong><u>SALARY CERTIFICATE</u></strong></p>\n<p>This is to certify that Mr./Ms. <strong>{Employee name}</strong>, holder of Qatar ID No. <strong>{Employee QID}</strong>, nationality {Employee nationality}, is working with <strong>{Company name}</strong> as <strong>{Employee job}</strong> since {Employee joining date}.</p>\n<table>\n<tr><td><strong>Basic salary</strong></td><td>QAR {Employee basic}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Allowances</strong></td><td>QAR {Employee allowances}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Total monthly salary</strong></td><td><strong>QAR {Employee salary}</strong></td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>This certificate is issued upon the employee\'s request for [Purpose], without any liability on the company.</p>\n<p>Yours faithfully,</p>\n<p>{Signature} {Stamp}</p>\n<p><strong>{Signatory name}</strong><br>{Signatory position}<br>{Company name}</p>\n','<p style="text-align:right">Date: {Today}<br>Ref: {Letter number}</p>\n<p>To,<br><strong>{Customer name}</strong><br>{Customer address}</p>\n<p><strong><u>Subject: Confirmation of account balance as of [Balance date]</u></strong></p>\n<p>Dear Sir / Madam,</p>\n<p>As per our books, the balance of your account with <strong>{Company name}</strong> as of [Balance date] is <strong>QAR {Customer balance}</strong>.</p>\n<p>Kindly confirm this balance by signing and returning a copy of this letter within 7 days. If you do not agree, please let us know the difference with details.</p>\n<p>Yours faithfully,</p>\n<p>{Signature} {Stamp}</p>\n<p><strong>{Signatory name}</strong><br>{Signatory position}<br>{Company name}</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Confirmed by {Customer name}</strong><br>Name: ____________________   Signature: ____________________   Date: __________</p>\n','<p style="text-align:right">Date: {Today}<br>Ref: {Letter number}</p>\n<p>To,<br><strong>The Branch Manager</strong><br>{Bank name}, {Bank branch}</p>\n<p><strong><u>Subject: Request for bank statement</u></strong></p>\n<p>Dear Sir / Madam,</p>\n<p>We kindly request you to issue the statement of our account below for the period from [From date] to [To date].</p>\n<table>\n<tr><td><strong>Account name</strong></td><td>{Bank account holder}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Account no.</strong></td><td>{Bank account no.}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>IBAN</strong></td><td>{Bank IBAN}</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>Please hand it to [Collected by] or send it to {Company email}.</p>\n<p>Yours faithfully,</p>\n<p>{Signature} {Stamp}</p>\n<p><strong>{Signatory name}</strong><br>{Signatory position}<br>{Company name}</p>\n','<p style="text-align:right">Date: {Today}<br>Ref: {Letter number}</p>\n<p>To,<br>The Director<br><strong>Food Safety Department</strong><br>Ministry of Public Health, State of Qatar</p>\n<p><strong><u>Subject: Request for release of food shipment \u2014 Declaration No. [Declaration number]</u></strong></p>\n<p>Dear Sir,</p>\n<p>We, <strong>{Company name}</strong> (CR No. {Company CR}), kindly request the release of our food shipment arrived at [Port] under the details below:</p>\n<table>\n<tr><td><strong>Declaration no.</strong></td><td><strong>Container no.</strong></td><td><strong>Product</strong></td><td><strong>Quantity</strong></td><td><strong>Origin</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>[Declaration number]</td><td>[Container numbers]</td><td>[Product]</td><td>[Quantity]</td><td>[Country of origin]</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>Supplier: {Supplier name}. Bill of lading: [Bill of lading].</p>\n<p>All the required documents (health certificate, certificate of origin, invoice and packing list) are attached. We confirm that the goods are fit for human consumption and will be stored as required.</p>\n<p>We thank you for your kind cooperation.</p>\n<p>Yours faithfully,</p>\n<p>{Signature} {Stamp}</p>\n<p><strong>{Signatory name}</strong><br>{Signatory position}<br>{Company name}</p>\n','<p style="text-align:right">Date: {Today}<br>Ref: {Letter number}</p>\n<p>To,<br><strong>{Customer name}</strong><br>{Customer address}</p>\n<p><strong><u>Subject: [Subject]</u></strong></p>\n<p>Dear Sir / Madam,</p>\n<p>[Message]</p>\n<p>Yours faithfully,</p>\n<p>{Signature} {Stamp}</p>\n<p><strong>{Signatory name}</strong><br>{Signatory position}<br>{Company name}</p>\n',u.fP],t.w)
